ript" source="#source-82039-82051">レ</note><seg source="#source-82051-82069">王。始五員與</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82069-82081">二</note><seg source="#source-82081-82090">申包胥</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82090-82102">一</note><seg source="#source-82102-82105">爲</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82105-82117">レ</note><seg source="#source-82117-82141">交。員之亡也。謂</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82141-82153">二</note><seg source="#source-82153-82159">包胥</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82159-82171">一</note><seg source="#source-82171-82186">曰。我必覆</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82186-82198">レ</note><seg source="#source-82198-82225">楚。包胥曰。我必存</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82225-82237">レ</note><seg source="#source-82237-82246">之。及</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82246-82258">二</note><seg source="#source-82258-82267">呉兵入</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82267-82282">一レ</note><seg source="#source-82282-82300">郢。伍子胥求</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82300-82312">二</note><seg source="#source-82312-82318">昭王</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82318-82330">一</note><seg source="#source-82330-82339">。既不</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82339-82351">レ</note><seg source="#source-82351-82363">得。乃掘</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82363-82375">二</note><seg source="#source-82375-82387">楚平王墓</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-82387-82399">一